WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
PF₆⁻-bearing battery wastewater flows through the ion-exchange resin bed.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
Multiple columns alternate adsorption and elution duties through shared valves and manifolds.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
Rich eluate leaves the capture module and passes through heat exchange.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
The crystalliser cutaway shows the circulating bed and KPF₆ crystal formation.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.000
The integrated recovery train connects capture, elution, heat exchange and crystallisation.
